    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-20T21:18:41+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-20T21:18:41+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T10:48:41Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-20T10:48:41Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A low pressure trough about eastern South Australia moves east to clear the state Friday evening. A weak high pressure system about the west moves across the state on Saturday. A trough of low pressure and cold front move into the west late Saturday evening and cross the remainder of of South Australia on Sunday. Another cold front clips the southeast on Monday, followed by a high pressure system, which will then move across southern parts of the state on Tuesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW010" description="West Coast" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <warning-summary type="fire_weather_warning" start-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z">Fire Weather Warning for the West Coast fire weather district for Saturday</warning-summary>
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-20T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of fog south of Streaky Bay in the early morning. Slight chance of a shower south of Streaky Bay at night. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the late afternoon and evening. Winds east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 35 to 55 km/h in the morning then tending south to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 19 with daytime temperatures reaching around 40.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Extreme</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 5:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 12 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers east of Ceduna in the morning. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm east of Ceduna in the morning. Winds southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h becoming light before dawn then becoming west to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h in the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 16 and 19 with daytime temperatures reaching 27 to 32.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the day then tending south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 12 with daytime temperatures reaching 22 to 27.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds south to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning then tending southeast to southwesterly during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 12 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
